      "statements": [
        {
          "id": "A1",
          "text": "Everything the model does not include stays at its baseline: fuel consumption, other costs, traffic, capacity, fares (apart from the stated pass-through) and financing."
        },
        {
          "id": "A3",
          "text": "The fuel bill is consumption × the benchmark jet fuel price × the exchange rate. Taxes, fees and supplier margins that do not follow the benchmark are outside the model."
        },
        {
          "id": "A6",
          "text": "Hedged fuel pays the baseline US-dollar price until the hedges expire; the exchange rate is not hedged; hedges are not rolled over."
        },
